{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/pulls/1646","id":5170994389,"node_id":"PR_kwDOQ8oa8s8AAAABNDcc1Q","html_url":"https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/pull/1646","diff_url":"https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/pull/1646.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/pull/1646.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/issues/1646","number":1646,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[I17:E01] Issue Artifacts: Linked Contracts and Executing Commands","user":{"login":"m2ux","id":176900785,"node_id":"U_kgDOCotKsQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176900785?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux","html_url":"https://github.com/m2ux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Overview\n\nIssue and body artifacts expose linked input/output contracts and execute commands within numbered heading steps. The conversion preserves their conditions, command syntax, templates and prerequisite sections.\n\n## Changes\n\n### Artifact Operations\n\n- **Execute commands in their steps.**\n  The issue/body family uses raw HTML command blocks with contract-linked arguments and preserves existing callable anchors.\n\n### Record Contracts\n\n- **Name accepted inputs and returned states.**\n  Complete JSON records, body text, identities, metadata and supplied versus posted comment states have distinct contracts.\n\n### Template Reading\n\n- **Recognize indented closing fences.**\n  The template reader matches valid closing-fence indentation, character and length; malformed closers remain rejected.\n\n### Interface Verification\n\n- **Check heading procedures and script reach.**\n  Document readers preserve linked contracts, step ordering, fetched-base inputs and cited executable coverage while excluding literal specimens.\n\n## Test Plan\n\n| Test | Description | Coverage | Pass |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| T1 | Literal-head strict artifact model, source preservation and walked-byte identity | AC5 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-05-1616-i17-e01-w05-issue-and-body-artifacts/validation.md#artifact-structure-and-preservation) |\n| T2 | Complete Work Planner suite, including formatter regressions and maintained document readers | AC5 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-05-1616-i17-e01-w05-issue-and-body-artifacts/validation.md#behavioral-suites) |\n| T3 | Complete shared skill checker suite | | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-05-1616-i17-e01-w05-issue-and-body-artifacts/validation.md#behavioral-suites) |\n| T4 | Account for six bounded walk results, stored receipts and explicit Partial disclosure limitations | | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-05-1616-i17-e01-w05-issue-and-body-artifacts/validation.md#disclosure-evidence-audit) |\n| T5 | Record the inherited installed-model Fields diagnostic separately from strict family acceptance | | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-05-1616-i17-e01-w05-issue-and-body-artifacts/validation.md#installed-model-boundary) |\n\n## References\n\n- **R1.** [Planning and evidence](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/tree/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-05-1616-i17-e01-w05-issue-and-body-artifacts) — the design, preservation ledger, exact-head checks and six-walk Partial disclosure account.\n","created_at":"2026-11-05T11:45:28Z","updated_at":"2026-11-05T11:49:11Z","closed_at":"2026-11-05T11:49:11Z","merged_at":"2026-11-05T11:49:11Z","merge_commit_sha":"709a038e40aafb59a05c1798f3d1a6b1f9248e83","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/pulls/1646/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/pulls/1646/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/issues/1646/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/statuses/c2b3dc2292fb7ba6aedc4b014d0e5bef084bd7a9","head":{"label":"m2ux:i17/e01/w05-issue-and-body-artifacts","ref":"i17/e01/w05-issue-and-body-artifacts","sha":"c2b3dc2292fb7ba6aedc4b014d0e5bef084bd7a9","user":{"login":"m2ux","id":176900785,"node_id":"U_kgDOCotKsQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176900785?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux","html_url":"https://github.com/m2ux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_